11. packages/gateway-schema/src/contract/literals/downstream.ts：INVOKE_ACTIONS 声明为对象，聚合所有字段，后续外部仅消费该对象，参考 TRANSPORT_UPSTREAM_MESSAGE_TYPES
12. packages/gateway-schema/src/adapters/validators/downstream-normalizer.ts：case 内部逻辑相似，存在大量重复逻辑
13. packages/gateway-schema/src/adapters/validators/transport-message-validator.ts：存在大量重复逻辑
14. packages/bridge-runtime-sdk/src/application/constants/gateway-messages.ts：bridge-runtime-sdk 没必要重复定义类型，统一从 gateway-schema 导出
15. packages/gateway-schema/src/contract/schemas/downstream.ts：大量重复逻辑，确认类似 `(xx: xx2): {}` 的结构是否有必要
